---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Hallmark Studio"
  description="Hallmark Studio's privacy policy. How we collect, use, and protect your data. Based in Chelmsford, Essex."
  noindex={false}
>

  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-header__sub">Last updated: June 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="prose" style="max-width:none;">

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Hallmark Studio is a web design and SEO agency based in Chelmsford, Essex, UK. We work with small businesses across Essex to build websites and improve their visibility on Google.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this policy, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@hallmarkstudio.com">hello@hallmarkstudio.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What data we collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information in two ways:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Information you give us directly:</strong> when you fill in a contact form or request a free audit, we collect your name, email address or phone number, and any other details you include in your message.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Analytics data:</strong> if you accept cookies, we use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our site. This includes pages visited, time on site, and general location (country/city level). It does not identify you personally.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use your data</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your enquiry or audit request.</li>
          <li>To understand how people use our site and improve it (analytics only, with consent).</li>
          <li>We do not sell your data to third parties.</li>
          <li>We do not use your data for automated profiling or decision-making.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          We use one category of cookie:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Analytics cookies (Google Analytics):</strong> used to measure site traffic and behaviour. These are only set if you click "Accept cookies" on the banner. You can opt out at any time by clicking "Essential only" on the banner, or by clearing your cookies and declining again.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          No cookies are set before you make a choice. Your preference is saved in your browser's local storage.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact form data</h2>
        <p>
          Form submissions are processed by <a href="https://formspree.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Formspree</a> and sent directly to our email inbox. Formspree's privacy policy governs their handling of submission data. We store your details only as long as needed to respond to your enquiry.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> analytics (consent required). <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's privacy policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Formspree:</strong> contact form processing. <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Formspree's privacy policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Calendly:</strong> call booking (only if you click the Calendly link). <a href="https://calendly.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Calendly's privacy policy</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Your rights under UK GDPR</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access the personal data we hold about you.</li>
          <li>Ask us to correct inaccurate data.</li>
          <li>Ask us to delete your data.</li>
          <li>Object to how we process your data.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@hallmarkstudio.com">hello@hallmarkstudio.com</a>. We will respond within 30 days.
        </p>

        <h2>Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          We keep enquiry and audit request data for up to 12 months. If no project proceeds, we delete your details on request.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent revision. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Hallmark Studio<br />
          Chelmsford, Essex, UK<br />
          <a href="mailto:hello@hallmarkstudio.com">hello@hallmarkstudio.com</a><br />
          <a href="tel:07570947291">07570 947291</a>
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
